<title>SOUTH AFRICA: JCI RENEWS LONRHO TALKS CAUTIONARY.</title>
<headline>JCI RENEWS LONRHO TALKS CAUTIONARY.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African mining house JCI Ltd on Friday renewed an earlier cautionary saying that discussions were continuing with mining-to-hotels group Lonrho Plc in respect of a merger.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
